  "hint": "SUMIFS with two conditions on order_date: \">=\"&DATE(2025,10,1) and \"<=\"&DATE(2025,12,31).",
  "explanation": "₦160.8m: nearly 30% of 2025's revenue came in the last three months.",
  "required": true
}
```

